  ('88789ef6-cd05-52f7-a84c-fbc7f572e92a', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g3-narrative-writing'), null, 'hard',
   $q$The writer wants to add a sentence between sentences 8 and 9 that shows the writer's thought. Which is best?$q$, $q$[{"text":"I thought, \"Now I remember how my line goes!\"","is_correct":true},{"text":"Priya had a part in the play too.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"fact-not-thought"},{"text":"Priya was wearing a green shirt that night.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"detail-not-thought"},{"text":"The curtain behind the stage was dark red.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"detail-not-thought"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$I thought, "Now I remember how my line goes!"$q$, $q$Only "I thought" tells what is in the writer's mind, and it links Priya's help to the shouted line in sentence 9. The choices about the green shirt, the dark red curtain, and Priya having a part only add facts.$q$, 'draft', 'd3e0af7f-3112-505c-aa00-aae399151391')
