   $q$Which line of dialogue best fills the blank as sentence 9?$q$, $q$[{"text":"\"Wow, I have never seen a real sea star before,\" Tariq whispered.","is_correct":true},{"text":"\"I am bored, so let's go get some lunch now,\" Tariq said.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-story"},{"text":"\"My shoes are getting wet,\" Tariq said.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"off-topic-dialogue"},{"text":"\"Our car is parked over by the road,\" Tariq said.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"off-topic-dialogue"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$"Wow, I have never seen a real sea star before," Tariq whispered.$q$, $q$Tariq's quiet amazement fits sentence 8, which shows the sea star, and sentence 10, where they watch silently for a long time. Saying "I am bored" does not fit, because the children keep watching until the tide comes in.$q$, 'draft', '23ddbd72-bc76-58e8-b44e-a11008caf5a5')
