-- Passage wg3-narrative-writing-p08
insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('5fad8927-36cc-53e2-90c1-28a453e7b2b3', 'wg3-narrative-writing-p08', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g3-narrative-writing'), null,
        '3-5', $q$A School From Long Ago$q$, $q$(1) On Friday, our class visited a schoolhouse that is more than one hundred years old. (2) It had only one room, with a wood stove in the middle. (3) A guide named Mrs. Lindqvist rang a big brass bell to start the day. (4) We sat on hard wooden benches and wrote on small slate boards with chalk. (5) My slate squeaked every time I made a letter.

(6) Mrs. Lindqvist said that children of every age once learned together in this room. (7) I tried to imagine my little sister and me sitting side by side in class. (8) Next, we each took a turn pumping water from an old pump outside. (9) The handle was so heavy that I had to use both hands. (10) My favorite color is blue.$q$, 'draft')
