   $q$After sentence 10 is removed, which sentence would best end the story?$q$, $q$[{"text":"As the bus pulled away, I looked back and felt glad I had seen how school used to be.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The bell that Mrs. Lindqvist rang was made of shiny brass.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"repeats-detail"},{"text":"My school today has a computer lab and a big gym with a stage.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"shifts-topic"},{"text":"The next week, our class visited a farm and fed some goats.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"starts-new-event"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$As the bus pulled away, I looked back and felt glad I had seen how school used to be.$q$, $q$Leaving on the bus and feeling glad about what was learned closes the visit. The farm trip is a new event, so it opens a new story instead of ending this one.$q$, 'draft', '5fad8927-36cc-53e2-90c1-28a453e7b2b3')
