   $q$Sentence 8 begins with "Next." Why is this a good word to use there?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It shows that pumping water was the most important part of the trip.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-order-with-importance"},{"text":"It shows that the story took place more than one hundred years ago.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-setting-time"},{"text":"It tells the reader that the story is ending right there.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-transition-with-closing"},{"text":"It shows that pumping water came after the class time inside the room.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It shows that pumping water came after the class time inside the room.$q$, $q$"Next" moves the story from the benches and slates inside to the pump outside, keeping the events in order. It does not mean the pump was most important, only that it came later.$q$, 'draft', '5fad8927-36cc-53e2-90c1-28a453e7b2b3')
